Z||000000||JohnnyK||08-31-2000||07:09 PM||||I know this isn't Fiero, but I am doing a favour for ones of my dads friends, only I can't find it! I'm looking for the flasher in (I'd say around '91 or so. Not the newer bodies) a Cavalier, and I can't find it anywhere. Not near the fuses, the passenger side, the trunk, the hood. Geez. Anyone know?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000001||StuGood||08-31-2000||11:08 PM||||Do you mean, the flasher for the turn signals?||||reg||5
Z||000002||Monkeyman||08-31-2000||11:31 PM||||This should probably be in O/T.  Seems like it was under the center of the dash somewhere.  I had to change it in my cousins Cav ('89), but it's been a few years.||||reg||1
Z||000003||StuGood||08-31-2000||11:41 PM||||Must be the turn signal flasher you're looking for.  The hazard flasher is too easy to find for you to ask about  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>By the way, as you said, this really doesn't belong on the Fiero Forum!  Only dorks own Cavaliers   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Ahem...  on <B>my</B>1987 Cavalier   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> , there is a "convenience center" (with horn relay, blue dingy box, and the hazard flasher - similar to the Fiero's), underneath the dash, to the left of the steering column.<P>The turn signal flasher seems to be located <B>beneath</B> the "convenience center," surrounded by some relatively heavy framework for the IP and steering column (some "convenience," huh?).  It looks kind of like it plugs into the <B>RH side</B> of the fuse panel - not the side you can get to, from the flip-down access door, of course.  That'd be too easy   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> !<P>I don't know if the "convenience center" is readily removable so that you can get to the turn signal flasher beneath it - I've never had to mess with it.  Yet...<p>[This message has been edited by StuGood (edited 08-31-2000).]||||reg||12
Z||000004||JohnnyK||09-01-2000||02:48 PM||||Aight, thanks guys. Sorry it wasn't it o/t, I was just sort of in a rush.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I couldn't even find it after all this. Oh well.||||reg||1
